<title>HUNGARY: UJPEST AND AARHUS DRAW 0-0 IN UEFA PRELIM FIRST LEG.</title>
<headline>UJPEST AND AARHUS DRAW 0-0 IN UEFA PRELIM FIRST LEG.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ujpest of Hungary and Aarhus of Denmark drew 0-0 in their UEFA Cup second preliminary round first leg match in Budapest on Tuesday. Attendance: 6,000</p>
</text>
